  "change": "During the existing frame settling interval the default Windows CPU reader prepares whole changed pages only while idle and a map or inventory panel is visible. The iGPU mode can also prepare on the free reader while exactly one older selected frame is still in flight. Selection verifies sequence, generation, provider configuration and exact view pixels. Full observations continue through the existing timeline.",
